Source data attribution
-----------------------
The transaction texts are derived from the following public datasets:

  - IEEE-CIS Fraud Detection (Kaggle Competition, 2019).
    https://www.kaggle.com/c/ieee-fraud-detection
  - PaySim mobile-money simulator. Lopez-Rojas et al., EMSS 2016.
  - UCI-Adult-style profiles (synthetic profiles in the released
    benchmark; not derived from the UCI Adult Census dataset itself —
    see CHECK.md / paper §5 for caveat).
  - Synthetic medical risk scenarios authored by the DeAnchor authors.

Users redistributing these artifacts must comply with the original source
licenses for the underlying transaction text where applicable.

